libsvm_nu_svr_model.txt is the default audio-mode similarity-to-quality model,
copied unmodified from https://github.com/google/visqol (model/libsvm_nu_svr_model.txt,
Apache-2.0).

lattice_speech_model.bin holds the parameters of the default speech-mode
similarity-to-quality model (a TensorFlow Lattice calibrated lattice ensemble),
extracted verbatim from the upstream TFLite flatbuffer
(model/lattice_tcditugenmeetpackhref_ls2_nl60_lr12_bs2048_learn.005_ep2400_train1_7_raw.tflite,
Apache-2.0) by extract_lattice_model.py. See src/lattice.rs for the
format and the inference semantics.
